What is Cloud PBX?
Cloud PBX (Private Branch Exchange) is an advanced internet-based phone system that replaces traditional on-premises PBX systems. These tools enable businesses to manage voice calls, video conferencing, messaging, and other unified communications services through cloud platforms. Key features include virtual phone numbers, intelligent call routing, voicemail-to-email transcription, auto-attendants, and seamless integration with CRM systems.
